---

This project is an independent, clean-room reimplementation. It contains no
code, assets or text from the SwiftTec Song Management System.

The documents under `docs/legacy/` describe that product's observable behaviour
and file formats, recorded for interoperability: the ability to read song files
the author already owns. "SwiftTec Song Management System" is the product of
SwiftTec and is referenced descriptively only.
